<!-- Status-bar icon for a push notification.

     Android draws a notification icon from its alpha channel only: every
     coloured pixel becomes white, and every opaque pixel becomes part of the
     silhouette. A full-colour logo therefore arrives as a solid white blob,
     which is what the launcher icon was doing here. This is a flat shape with
     transparent space around it, so it renders as intended.

     A heart rather than the full foundation mark: at 24dp in a status bar the
     logo's lettering and ring are illegible, and an unreadable mark is worse
     than a clear symbol. -->
